WEBVTT

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.098
CH: How confident are you
that some of that collaboration

00:03:31.122 --> 00:03:32.522
can happen right now?

00:03:34.405 --> 00:03:38.000
RD: We're now at one
of those defining moments

00:03:38.024 --> 00:03:39.757
that I've seen repeatedly.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:44.933
The 1930-45 period,
if you go back in history,

00:03:44.957 --> 00:03:46.824
there's nothing new to this.

00:03:47.172 --> 00:03:49.537
And it's a defining moment

00:03:49.561 --> 00:03:52.494
in terms of how people are
with each other.

00:03:52.885 --> 00:03:54.617
So when you look at it,

00:03:54.641 --> 00:03:57.212
will people come together

00:03:57.236 --> 00:04:00.458
or, when it comes down to it, really,